<section class="section section--flush page-hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Industrial Automation Services</h1></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><p>ISYSTEMS AUTOMATION covers the full project cycle: engineering, procurement, installation supervision, commissioning, acceptance testing and maintenance for industrial control systems.</p>
<p>Work spans DCS and ESD on Emerson Ovation, ABB 800xA, Siemens PCS7, Yokogawa Centum, HIMA and Triconex, plus MES, safety systems and control room design.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2 class="section-title">Process Automation</h2><div class="section-promo__layout section-promo__layout--lead"><figure class="figure--embed"><img src="/assets/img/2024/08/10/process_automation.jpg" alt="Process automation control system" width="635" height="505" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Process automation control system</figcaption></figure><div class="section-promo__text"><h3>Turnkey automation projects</h3><p>Engineering, procurement, installation supervision, commissioning and acceptance testing for DCS and ESD — technical coordination, materials to specification, and documentation to the client's requirements.</p>
